{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36602","headline":"锺陵见杨秀才 · 罗隐","name":"锺陵见杨秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孺亭滕阁少踟蹰，三度南游一事无。\n秪觉流年如鸟逝，不知何处有龙屠？\n云归洪井枝柯敛，水下漳江气色麤。\n赖得与君同此醉，醒来愁被鬼揶揄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}